tools: current 6.1 lifter (Mudb0y lift64 sync)

Takes tools/rules/lift64.py whole at upstream HEAD: money shapes,
frame-cell nearest-below reads, negative-double census, private
fence counts, silent-fault mends, double rounding, Finnish and
Portuguese shapes. Standalone CLI (Apple modules in, .up out);
nothing in the build imports it, and there is no Apple module in
this tree to run it on, so this changes no build output. It is
what any future re-lift would run.

